---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout {...{"title": "Summer Day Camp | Hide and Seek Day Camp", "description": "Six weekly sessions in June and July, Monday through Friday, 9 a.m. to 3 p.m. Campers spend the day outside in small groups with a counselor who stays with them all week.", "path": "/explore-camp/summer-day-camp/", "banner": {"pos": "30% 30%", "img": "/img/summer-header.webp", "alt": "Campers cheering for the camera", "eyebrow": "Finished kindergarten through finished 5th grade", "title": "Summer Day Camp", "intro": "Six weekly sessions in June and July, Monday through Friday, 9 a.m. to 3 p.m. Campers spend the day outside in small groups with a counselor who stays with them all week.", "h1": "title", "crumb": {"href": "/explore-camp/", "label": "Explore Camp"}}}}>
  <div class="sec" style="padding-bottom:0"><div class="wrap g4">
    <div class="card"><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:8px">Grades</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:26px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em">K to 5th</p></div>
    <div class="card"><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:8px">Hours</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:26px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em">9 to 3</p></div>
    <div class="card"><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:8px">Cost</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:26px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em">$275 a week</p></div>
    <div class="card"><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:8px">Campuses</p><p style="margin:0;font-size:26px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.02em">All three</p></div>
  </div></div>
  <div class="sec"><div class="wrap g2" style="gap:56px;align-items:center">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">A day at camp</p><h2 class="h2">The shape of every weekday</h2>
      <div style="margin-top:8px">
        <div class="acc" style="border-top-color:#20180f"><p class="s" style="color:#20180f;font-weight:600">7:30 to 9 a.m. &nbsp;Early drop off</p></div>
        <div class="acc"><p class="s" style="color:#20180f;font-weight:600">9:15 to 9:45 a.m. &nbsp;Snacks</p></div>
        <div class="acc"><p class="s" style="color:#20180f;font-weight:600">9:45 to 10:15 a.m. &nbsp;Assembly</p></div>
        <div class="acc"><p class="s" style="color:#20180f;font-weight:600">10:15 to 11:45 a.m. &nbsp;Rotating activities</p></div>
        <div class="acc"><p class="s" style="color:#20180f;font-weight:600">11:45 a.m. to 12:15 p.m. &nbsp;Lunch from home</p></div>
        <div class="acc"><p class="s" style="color:#20180f;font-weight:600">12:15 to 2:45 p.m. &nbsp;Rotating activities</p></div>
        <div class="acc"><p class="s" style="color:#20180f;font-weight:600">2:45 to 3 p.m. &nbsp;Carpool</p></div>
        <div class="acc" style="border-bottom:1px solid #e2d9c6"><p class="s" style="color:#20180f;font-weight:600">3 to 6 p.m. &nbsp;Late pick up</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:14px">
      <div class="ph" style="height:210px"><img src="/img/summer-01.webp" alt="Camper walking across the field"></div>
      <div class="ph" style="height:210px;margin-top:28px"><img src="/img/summer-12.webp" alt="Campers sitting together at assembly"></div>
      <div class="ph" style="height:210px"><img src="/img/summer-03.webp" alt="Camper climbing a rope net"></div>
      <div class="ph" style="height:210px;margin-top:28px"><img src="/img/summer-04.webp" alt="Campers and counselors walking across the field" style="object-position:50% 40%"></div>
    </div>
  </div></div>
  <div class="tint" style="padding:88px clamp(20px,3vw,40px)"><div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="h2" style="margin-bottom:32px">Activities</h2>
    <div class="g4">
      <div><div class="ph" style="height:180px"><img src="/img/summer-05.webp" alt="Camper in a helmet climbing up to the zipline"></div><p class="s" style="margin-top:12px;color:#20180f;font-weight:600">Zipline</p></div>
      <div><div class="ph" style="height:180px"><img src="/img/summer-06.webp" alt="Camper in a helmet at the rock wall"></div><p class="s" style="margin-top:12px;color:#20180f;font-weight:600">Rock wall</p></div>
      <div><div class="ph" style="height:180px"><img src="/img/summer-02.webp" alt="Campers playing gaga ball" style="object-position:85% 50%"></div><p class="s" style="margin-top:12px;color:#20180f;font-weight:600">Gaga ball and 9 square</p></div>
      <div><div class="ph" style="height:180px"><img src="/img/summer-07.webp" alt="Camper on the low ropes"></div><p class="s" style="margin-top:12px;color:#20180f;font-weight:600">Ninja island low ropes</p></div>
      <div><div class="ph" style="height:180px"><img src="/img/summer-08.webp" alt="Camper climbing the crate stack" style="object-position:50% 30%"></div><p class="s" style="margin-top:12px;color:#20180f;font-weight:600">Crate stack</p></div>
      <div><div class="ph" style="height:180px"><img src="/img/summer-09.webp" alt="Camper at the craft table" style="object-position:50% 40%"></div><p class="s" style="margin-top:12px;color:#20180f;font-weight:600">Arts and crafts</p></div>
      <div><div class="ph" style="height:180px"><img src="/img/summer-10.webp" alt="Campers playing field games"></div><p class="s" style="margin-top:12px;color:#20180f;font-weight:600">Field games</p></div>
      <div><div class="ph" style="height:180px"><img src="/img/summer-11.webp" alt="Camper on the slip and slide"></div><p class="s" style="margin-top:12px;color:#20180f;font-weight:600">Thursday water day</p></div>
    </div>
    <p class="p" style="margin-top:24px">Friday is open woods, free reign of the outdoor activities.</p>
  </div></div>
  <div class="sec"><div class="wrap g2" style="gap:56px;align-items:center">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">Bible teaching</p><h2 class="h2">Taught on the walk between activities</h2><p class="p">Curriculum rotations sit alongside the games. Campers memorize scripture and talk about the character of God on walks around camp.</p><p class="s" style="font-weight:600;color:#20180f">Matthew 6:33 and Psalm 119:11</p></div>
    <div class="ph" style="height:340px"><img src="/img/gallery-mg4854.webp" alt="Counselor with a group of boys"></div>
  </div></div>
  <div class="sec" style="padding-top:0"><div class="wrap">
    <div style="position:relative;border-radius:32px;overflow:hidden;padding:72px 56px;display:flex;align-items:center">
      <img src="/img/gallery-dsc09982.webp" alt="Campers gathered together outside" style="object-position:5% 15%;position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover">
      <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(36,91,131,.95) 0%,rgba(36,91,131,.8) 55%,rgba(36,91,131,.4) 100%)"></div>
      <div style="position:relative;max-width:560px"><h2 class="h2" style="color:#fff">Pick your weeks</h2><p class="p" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,.88);margin-bottom:28px">Registration opens March 1 and sessions fill quickly at Hickory Flat.</p><div class="row"><a href="https://www.ultracamp.com/clientlogin.aspx?idCamp=307&amp;campcode=hns&amp;lang=en-Us" data-ev="register_click" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="gold">Register on UltraCamp</a><a href="/parent-info/faqs/" class="ghostL">Parent guide and FAQs</a></div></div>
    </div>
  </div></div>
</Layout>
